  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> At least two casting traditions with Card Casting</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may combine cards from multiple different casting traditions into a single deck, rather than having each casting tradition have its own deck. You may still have up to one deck per casting tradition with Card Casting you possess. For each deck that combines cards from multiple casting traditions, you must select a single tradition for the purpose of determining which deck manipulations and drawback feats apply to the cards in the deck.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/card-and-deck-feats#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
